WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:04.519
Speaker 1
Today I invite you to prepare together a wonderful orache soup recipe, just like in

2
00:00:04.519 --> 00:00:08.690
Oltenia. It's very tasty, aromatic, with plenty of vegetables and lots of

3
00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:13.010
greens. It's perfect after a period when we ate far too much meat.

4
00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:17.480
Let's prepare it together. For the ingredients, we will need

5
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:21.829
6 bunches of orache, 2 bunches of sorrel, 2 onions finely chopped

6
00:00:21.829 --> 00:00:25.910
half a liter of borscht, 2 red peppers cut into

7
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.410
cubes, a bunch of lovage, two carrots, a quarter of

8
00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:35.030
celery root, 4–5 tablespoons of oil, and a pinch of salt. This

9
00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:39.080
sorrel soup recipe is very easy and very tasty. I'll start

10
00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:44.360
with the oil that I'll put in a pot, and now

11
00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:48.770
Speaker 1
I'll let it heat up. When the oil is hot, I'll add

12
00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:54.290
Speaker 1
the onion. The bell pepper.

13
00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:02.390
The celery and the carrot. I'll season with a little

14
00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:07.220
salt. And I'll cook the vegetables until they soften, about 5

15
00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:11.270
Speaker 1
minutes. Make sure not to fry them, but just sauté them enough for them to release their

16
00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:16.700
juices. When the vegetables have softened and look like this

17
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:23.330
Speaker 1
they should look. We can

18
00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:28.100
add about three liters of water over them. We cook

19
00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:32.000
the vegetables for about 10–15 minutes or until they are

20
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.800
almost done. At this point, you can also add a little rice

21
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:41.180
or potatoes while the vegetables are cooking. I can take care of the greens and

22
00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:46.010
I'll start with the orache. Here I have some beautiful red orache,

23
00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:53.240
Speaker 1
which I'll chop. As you could

24
00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:56.600
see, I've also kept a bit of the stem because it's very healthy.

25
00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:02.030
Optionally, you can add some sorrel. I like to add it because I have it in

26
00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:06.200
Speaker 1
my garden and because it's green and, of course, because it's just as

27
00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:11.600
healthy. Sorrel has a sour taste and goes

28
00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.190
Speaker 1
very well in this soup.

29
00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:27.950
Speaker 1
The vegetables have boiled, so I can add the sorrel and orache mixture.

30
00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:35.020
Speaker 1
And I’ll let the soup boil for another 5 minutes.

31
00:02:38.919 --> 00:02:42.940
After those 5 minutes have passed, I will add the borscht that I boiled earlier.

32
00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:46.180
And I'll let it come to a few more boils.

33
00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:51.100
Speaker 1
At this point, taste the soup and add more salt if needed.

34
00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:59.740
After the soup has come to a few more boils, I can turn off the heat and

35
00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:03.970
add the chopped lovage. Of course, you can also add parsley and even

36
00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:07.690
Speaker 1
a little green onion. I’ll stir for the last time.

37
00:03:11.139 --> 00:03:15.430
And Oltenian orache soup is ready. Exactly how my

38
00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:20.050
grandmother used to make it. My dears, this is my orache soup recipe

39
00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:24.280
how I used to eat it in childhood. My grandmother made it very often in spring

40
00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:28.600
and it was absolutely delicious. You can also add,

41
00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:32.800
for example, rice or potatoes, but I like it plain for an extra

42
00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:37.270
flavor. You can serve it with a bit of sour cream or even some horseradish. This

43
00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:41.260
soup is wonderful in spring, has lots of vegetables, is very healthy

44
00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:45.310
and it's perfect after a period when I ate a lot of meat, as many of us did at Easter,

45
00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:49.450
I sincerely hope you try the recipe yourselves and that you enjoy it.

46
00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:50.620
Goodbye!
